@startuml
start
floating note right
Is there a new client asking to connect?
end note
:Call server.available();

:Check listening socket state;
if (socket is listening?) then (yes)
  :Attempt TCP accept() on server socket;
  if (new client connection pending?) then (yes)
    :Create a new WiFiClient object;
    :Assign client socket to it;
    :Return the client object;
  else (no)
    :Return invalid/empty client object;
  endif
else (no)
  :Server not started or socket invalid;
  :Return invalid/empty client object;
endif

stop
@enduml